{"author":"rebar-bridge[bot]","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1787963201255287366,"compiled_state":{"alias":"improvised-altophobic-azurevase","assignee":null,"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"d2221c75761c402f5074ba55374ff5f1b3b5d1be0f1a9afc4eb91d13ce73a0cd","event_uuid":"fe7519c2-a709-426b-b01e-b84f27614adc","position":{"commit_sha":"33527d0de72db518100e29d8e7b7bdbeb1b7339e","position":"1787959142952407001-fe7519c2-a709-426b-b01e-b84f27614adc"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"b8acc9e90a36cebb43d93402725e90e60a9c0b5bcc198844ae8b4be59c298a4a","event_uuid":"892e3f25-dc53-4441-a1a1-ddd1d540e6e0","position":{"commit_sha":"4062f2b75c277c772a93a82f90b17e466f1c00e7","position":"1787959179500912001-892e3f25-dc53-4441-a1a1-ddd1d540e6e0"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1787959142952407001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"892e3f25-dc53-4441-a1a1-ddd1d540e6e0","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"dd30-f10d-69f3-4c36"}],"description":"## Problem\n\n`terraform apply` against `infra/terraform` **cannot complete**. The plan creates four `aws_ssm_parameter.rebar_secrets` entries, but three of them already exist in AWS and are not tracked in state:\n\n- `/rebar/prod/mcp-client-pat-claude` — exists at v1, not in state\n- `/rebar/prod/mcp-client-pat-codex` — exists at v1, not in state\n- `/rebar/prod/mcp-client-pat-copilot` — exists at v1, not in state\n\nThere is no `import` block for any of them (`grep \"to = aws_ssm_parameter\"` returns only the three Jira ones). The plan JSON shows `overwrite = null` on all four creates, so the provider issues `PutParameter` with `Overwrite=false` and AWS returns **`ParameterAlreadyExists`**. The apply fails partway.\n\n`/rebar/prod/mcp-tickets-pat` does not exist, so its create is the only clean one.\n\nMeasured 2026-08-28 via `terraform plan -lock=false` plus `aws ssm describe-parameters` (metadata only — no parameter values were read).\n\n## Impact\n\nThis blocks any `terraform apply`, which in turn blocks certified closure of `rubied-nonvagrant-whimbrel` (dd30-f10d-69f3-4c36): its AC4/DoD5 require a completed apply, and no apply can succeed until this is resolved. It is a prerequisite, not a symptom of the templatefile bug.\n\nLive tokens are NOT at risk of being clobbered — `Overwrite=false` means the call fails rather than overwrites — so this is an availability problem, not a data-loss one.\n\n## The fix\n\nAdd `import` blocks adopting the three parameters, mirroring the existing pattern at `ssm.tf:172-185`. `rebar_secrets` already carries `lifecycle { ignore_changes = [value] }` (`ssm.tf:97-99`), so adoption preserves the live values rather than rewriting them.\n\n## Operator awareness — the same plan also stops and starts live Gerrit\n\nSeparate from this bug but discovered with it, and it should be understood before ANY apply is authorised: the plan also carries `update aws_instance.gerrit` (user_data, in place). `user_data_replace_on_change` is unset so there is no replacement, but `public_ip` / `public_dns` are planned `(known after apply)` — the signature of a stop/start. That means an **outage of the Gerrit/MCP/review box and a public IP change**. The plan additionally creates two CloudWatch alarms (`mcp_mem_abort`, `mcp_retire_cap`) that are outside the templatefile fix's envelope.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] `import` blocks exist for all three `mcp-client-pat-*` parameters at the `rebar_secrets` addresses.\n- [ ] `terraform plan` shows the three as adopted (`no-op` or in-place), NOT as `create`.\n- [ ] The live parameter VALUES are unchanged after adoption — verified by version number remaining at v1, without reading the values themselves.\n- [ ] A plan run reaches a state where no `ParameterAlreadyExists` failure is reachable, evidenced from the plan JSON rather than inferred.\n\n## Testing\n\n- Re-run `terraform plan -input=false -no-color -lock=false` and diff the `resource_changes` actions for the four parameters before and after.\n- Anchor the check: confirm the plan JSON is being read for the right addresses by asserting a known-present resource appears as expected first — a query returning no `create` actions proves nothing if it is looking in the wrong place.\n- Never print parameter values; assert on metadata (existence, version, action) only. Scrub any plan file afterwards, since `prior_state` can embed live SSM values.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"9350-174a-3320-4e33","ticket_type":"bug","title":"terraform apply cannot complete: three live mcp-client-pat SSM parameters exist in AWS but are absent from state with no import block","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["fe7519c2-a709-426b-b01e-b84f27614adc","892e3f25-dc53-4441-a1a1-ddd1d540e6e0"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1787963201255287366,"uuid":"6716ce92-c550-4ce0-a139-675303afb51d"}